					Ph.
					2.35
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσήκοος ὦ Στρατονίκη</span>,
			epitaph in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Mus.Alex.</u>
				299
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <i>disobedient</i>, <i><span class="en">
