				2.117
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>; of an orator, <i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>VS</u>
				p.456
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i></div>
